                <mxCell id="c2-b" value="HTTPS · resposta privada sem cache&lt;br&gt;Web ACL e rate limit &lt;i&gt;(propostos)&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#3F4A56;" parent="1" vertex="1">
